data=col3,dbrow_2549
data=col4,dbrow_2547
data=col4,dbrow_2549

// 2547
[dbrow_2547]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Most of your skills require some kind of tool. For example, woodcutting requires a hatchet, and mining requires a pickaxe.<br><br>You start with a bronze hatchet, pickaxe and some other basic tools on your tool belt. Items on your tool belt are protected if you die.
data=col5,interface_1464:com_19
data=col6,4609
data=col7,1
data=col20,obj_1265
data=col21,interface_1464:com_19,4609

// 2548
[dbrow_2548]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Drag a prayer from the interface on the left onto the action bar for quick access.
data=col5,interface_1946:com_3
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1

// 2549
[dbrow_2549]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,When you find, buy or craft a better tool, such as an iron pickaxe, and have the skill level to equip the tool, it's a good idea to choose the <col=FFCB05>Add to tool belt</col> option on the tool in your backpack.<br>This will replace the item on your tool belt.
data=col5,interface_1464:com_19
data=col6,4609
data=col7,1
data=col20,obj_1267
data=col21,interface_1464:com_19,4609

