// 3130
[dbrow_3130]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,12
data=col1,30
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_01,The monolith has given me information on the icyene structure known as Everlight,<br>a lighthouse on Morytania's east coast.,sound_47941,500,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_01,More than just a lighthouse, though,<br>it served as a beacon of hope for the icyene race, newly migrated to Gielinor.,sound_47942,450,false,true,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_02a,But what could power such a beacon, to shine<br>so brightly day and night across the surrounding 'Hallowed' lands?,sound_47943,400,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_02a,And what opposing force of darkness could have snuffed out the Everlight<br>and sunk it beneath the waves?,sound_47944,450,false,true,true,true

// 3131
[dbrow_3131]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,13
data=col1,30
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_01,The sacking of Everlight was an atrocity, to be sure, but it was just a place, a thing.,sound_47921,500,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_01,The loss of not only many icyene people, but also their way of life, was the true tragedy here.,sound_47922,400,false,true,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_02b,Lord Drakan and his vampyres took such offence at this beacon<br>that they could not abide its existence.,sound_47923,450,true,false,true,true
data=col3,arch_cutscene_everlight_02b,Yet the surviving icyene, to this day, carry Everlight's<br>warmth and hope within them, an example to us all.,sound_47924,500,false,true,true,true

