// 3159
[dbrow_3159]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,6
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Lions and Unicorns and Centaurs, Oh My!
data=col4,42
data=col6,Many mounds of earth sit upon Everlight's central island.
data=col7,Everlight's central island is covered with burial mounds - icyene mass graves for those who fell during the sacking of Everlight at the hands of Lord Drakan.
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49779,1

// 3160
[dbrow_3160]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,7
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Ode to a Midsummer Morning
data=col4,51
data=col6,The amphitheatre stage is now sunk beneath the waves.
data=col7,Whatever epics were performed at Everlight's amphitheatre have been lost to time. Unfortunately, the team could not find any more detailed information about this area.
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49765,1

// 3161
[dbrow_3161]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,8
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Stadio Ga Ga
data=col4,69
data=col6,The remains of an oval stadium are evident at Everlight.
data=col7,The icyene instigated the Dominion Games - a huge sporting tournament for them and their allies. We've found evidence that lions, unicorns, centaurs, humans, aviansie and even seasingers took part!
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49763,1

// 3162
[dbrow_3162]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,9
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Home, Sweet Home
data=col4,72
data=col6,Everlight's Oikos island is littered with homes and studios.
data=col7,Artisan icyene worked and lived in the Oikos area of Everlight, using local resources to craft various containers and ceremonial items.
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49783,1

// 3163
[dbrow_3163]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,10
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Ground of the Polis
data=col4,92
data=col6,A ruined temple sits upon a high point of the southern area of Everlight.
data=col7,The acropolis on Everlight was home to icyene academics, philosophers and poets. They would have gathered here for public readings, talks and presentations, as well as debates.
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49799,1

// 3164
[dbrow_3164]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,11
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Battle of Optimatoi
data=col4,105
data=col6,Some remains of icyene soldiers in the underwater cave are in a line.
data=col7,It appears a squad of optimatoi made a last stand in front of Everlight's entrance.
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49795,1

// 3165
[dbrow_3165]
table=dbtable_90
data=col0,12
data=col1,2
data=col2,dbrow_2803
data=col3,Like Clockwork
data=col4,84
data=col6,Evidence of ancient clockwork machinery has been discovered at Everlight.
data=col7,The mechanism in Everlight's foundations appears to power an elevator that carries people up and down the length of the lighthouse. If we could get this working, we could reach the top!
data=col8,4000
data=col15,obj_49751,1

