// 3892
[dbrow_3892]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,26
data=col1,125
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,I was not always Azzanadra, your trusted friend.,sound_49581,320,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,Six thousand years ago I was Azzanadra, Pontifex Maximus of the Zarosian Empire.,sound_49588,450,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,I maintained civilisation and the rule of my lord against all those who called themselves gods.,sound_49589,500,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_1,I am very familiar with Seren's influence.,sound_49590,340,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_2,We can no longer rely on this council.,sound_49591,260,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_2,They are completely under her sway now.,sound_49592,260,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_2,In time they will recover their initiative, but for now they are nothing but puppets.,sound_49593,460,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_3,Disappointing, but not unexpected.,sound_49594,360,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_3,Seren is obsessed with the adult elder gods.,sound_49595,330,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_3,Her guilt and shame blind her to the true threat.,sound_49582,360,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,It is not the adults who are destined to destroy us. It is their unborn children.,sound_49583,420,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,If they wake, they will devour this world, and in time, all worlds.,sound_49584,440,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,If the best these fools can do is waste their time on senseless<br>appeasement, then it falls to us to save them.,sound_49585,520,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,We must find the elder god eggs.,sound_49586,220,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_1_4,We must stop them hatching.,sound_49587,260,false,true,true,true

// 3893
[dbrow_3893]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,27
data=col1,125
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_1,This world was lush, once. Green and flourishing. A perfect womb for the sleeping gods.,sound_49518,520,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_1,Within their shells, they slumbered in a yolk of incredible power.,sound_49526,300,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_1,The currents of magic drove more and more energy into the eggs,<br>until they reached bursting point.,sound_49527,420,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_2,Sensing the impending birth of their young, the adults pressed in close.,sound_49528,360,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_2,With a touch they imparted their identities and their memories.,sound_49529,350,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_3,The eggs burst open, and the hatchlings within emerged, ravenous.,sound_49530,350,true,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_4,Their mere presence drained all life from the cavern around them.,sound_49531,320,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_4,Within moments every other living thing nearby was dead, drained of all life.,sound_49532,400,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_5,Nothing could stop them. The world was doomed.,sound_49533,280,true,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_6,Further and further their reach expanded, blanketing everything.,sound_49519,250,true,true,true,false
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_7,Further and further their reach expanded, blanketing everything.,sound_2901,180,true,true,false,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_8,Minutes later, Freneskae was a desolate husk.,sound_49520,300,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_8,The sated hatchlings travelled out into the universe to remake it.,sound_49521,300,false,true,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_9,In time they grew old and hid eggs of their own beneath the surface of Gielinor.,sound_49522,380,true,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_9,When they hatch, our world will suffer the same fate as Freneskae.,sound_49523,350,false,false,true,true
data=col3,azzanadra_cutscene_2_9,We must stop them... somehow.,sound_49525,350,false,true,true,true

