// 4069
[dbrow_4069]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,29
data=col1,125
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_1_1,At the time, none of us realised the significance of the events that were about to unfold.,sound_50063,456,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_1_2,The followers of Zaros came first, descending on the Monolith to seize it for the dark lord.,sound_50066,450,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_1_3,My fellow ancients, awoken from their tombs,<br> commanded traitor knights to begin their assault.,sound_50065,505,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_1_3,But the worst was still to come.,sound_50064,300,false,true,true,true

// 4070
[dbrow_4070]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,30
data=col1,125
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_1,At last his plans had come to fruition.,sound_50067,350,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_2,The Monolith lay undefended.,sound_50071,200,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_3,With implacable will he forced it open, revealing the truth<br>that lay at its heart - a tear in the fabric of our reality.,sound_50073,620,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_4,Then he departed from this world, heedless of the devastation that would follow in his wake.,sound_50072,500,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_5,From that same gateway came beings of pure shadow, and with them a torrent of dark energy.,sound_50069,540,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_5,Left unchecked, it would choke our world.,sound_50070,300,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_2_5,But the worst was still to come.,sound_50068,350,false,true,true,true

// 4071
[dbrow_4071]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,31
data=col1,125
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_3_1,The invaders from beyond proved too much for the brave allies.,sound_50075,335,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_3_2,Yet hope was not lost - Gielinor had defenders still.,sound_50077,350,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_3_3,The TokHaar, the hands who created this world, the servants of<br>the Elder Gods themselves, stood with us.,sound_50076,400,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_3_3,But the worst was still to come.,sound_50074,250,false,true,true,true

// 4072
[dbrow_4072]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,32
data=col1,125
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_1,The priest, my friend, his heart filled with shame and confusion,<br>stood before the doom his efforts had wrought.,sound_50086,550,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_2,He grappled with the gateway, forcing it closed as it sought to consume him.,sound_50080,390,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_3,The Monolith snapped shut, but the backlash had nowhere else to go.,sound_50085,380,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_4,Pain cut through him as the corrupting energies tore into his body.,sound_50082,350,true,true,true,true
data=col3,black_placeholder,Silence enveloped him...but there would be no peace for the most faithful.,sound_50083,550,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_5,The desolate scream of the new god filled the air.,sound_50084,250,true,true,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_6,In the aftermath of the devastation, the TokHaar looked at what the<br>witless surface dwellers had done to their world.,sound_50081,500,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_6,Everything would have to be dismantled, starting with their former allies.,sound_50079,430,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_4_6,But the worst was still to come.,sound_50078,300,false,true,true,true

// 4073
[dbrow_4073]
table=dbtable_40
data=col0,33
data=col1,125
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_5_1,It is too late.,sound_50087,160,true,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_5_1,The invaders may have been defeated but the foul power<br>that seeped from the gateway has already done its work.,sound_50090,432,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_5_1,The Elder God eggs, imperiled by the poison, are hatching.,sound_50089,360,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_5_1,The young within will feast on our world.,sound_50091,350,false,false,true,true
data=col3,egwd_prerelease_cutscene_5_1,Now the worst is upon us.,sound_50088,350,false,true,true,true

// 4074
[dbrow_4074]
table=dbtable_129

// 4075
[dbrow_4075]
table=dbtable_130
data=col1,1,true,Overview,The Guardian's Gift is our way of saying thanks for your patience and support during the recent login lockouts.<br><br>Activate the item, then start choosing Wishes from the list.<br><br>Each Wish costs a certain amount of Charge. The amount is given in each Wish's description.<br><br>Once all the Charge in your Guardian's Gift is depleted, the item will disappear.<br><br>Thanks again, and enjoy your Wishes.
data=col1,2,false,Inventor's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Grants a Gizmo Shell that can be filled with any materials you've unlocked. It costs no materials to do so.<br><br>If you have access to Ancient Invention, this will grant an Ancient Gizmo Shell.
data=col1,3,false,Entrepreneur's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Grants items for running your Player-Owned Farm and Port, resetting your Chime-selling and Contract limits in the Arc, and a coupon that can choose a previous stock list held by the Travelling Merchant in the Deep-Sea Fishing hub.<br>  - 2 x Animal Name Re-roller<br>  - 2 x Animal Trait Re-roller<br>  - 2 x Animal Gender Change<br>  - 2 x Captain Reroll Token<br>  - 2 x Crew Reroll Token<br>  - 2 x Voyage Reroll Token<br>  - 10 x Ports Resource Crate<br>  - 1 x Travelling Merchant Coupon<br>  - 1 x Writ of Freelancing (Arc Contract Reset)<br>  - 1 x Writ of Barter (Arc Chime Reset)
data=col1,4,false,Warrior's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Grants items that help you fight longer, take on more Soul Reaper contracts, and reduce the sting of death:<br>  - 1 x Aura Refresh<br>  - 1 x Life Refresh<br>  - 1 x Soul Reaper Refresh<br>  - 1 x Item Protection Contract
data=col1,5,false,Wrangler's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Animals held in a Player-Owned Farm pen of your choice instantly produce at least one baby or egg. Then, a breeding cycle instantly completes - giving a chance at another. 
data=col1,6,false,Navigator's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Completes all of your active Player-Owned Port voyages.
data=col1,7,false,Archaeologist's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Completes your active Archaeology research.
data=col1,8,false,Wanderer's Wish,Members only.<br><br>Resets a daily, weekly or monthly D&D of your choice.
data=col1,9,false,Polymath's Wish,Grants you Double XP for an hour on members' worlds, or +20% XP on free-to-play worlds.<br><br>Normal Double XP restrictions apply. Cannot be claimed by Ironman accounts.

