// 4351
[dbrow_4351]
table=dbtable_130
data=col1,1,true,Overview,<br>Which Advanced Cocktail would you like to choose?<br><br>You can create new advanced cocktails that'll aid you on the beach.<br><br>These all last for <col=FFFFFF>15 minutes</col> each and stack with the effects of other beach cocktails.
data=col1,2,false,A Hole in One,<br>Drinking this will aid your ability to delve into the '<col=FFFFFF>Dungeoneering Hole</col>' activity.<br><br>XP gain is increased by <col=FFFFFF>+10%</col>.<br><br>You can now complete '<col=FFFFFF>60 floors</col>' before having to break.<br><br>Doing the activity won't increase your temperature gauge.<br><br>This effect lasts <col=FFFFFF>15 mins</col>.
data=col1,3,false,The Ugly Duckling,<br>Drinking this will aid your prowess at the '<col=FFFFFF>Hook a Duck</col>' activity.<br><br>XP gain is increased by <col=FFFFFF>three times your hunter level</col>.<br><br>Doing the activity won't increase your temperature gauge.<br><br>This effect lasts <col=FFFFFF>15 mins</col>.
data=col1,4,false,The Palmer Farmer,<br>Drinking this will aid your skill at picking coconuts from the '<col=FFFFFF>Palm Tree Farming</col>' activity.<br><br>XP gain is increased by <col=FFFFFF>+300%</col>.<br><br>Picking from trees no longer depletes fruit from the tree.<br><br>Doing the activity won't increase your temperature gauge.<br><br>This effect lasts <col=FFFFFF>15 mins</col>.
data=col1,5,false,Fisherman's Friend,<br>Drinking this will aid your ability to fish within the '<col=FFFFFF>Rock Pools</col>'.<br><br>XP gain is increased by <col=FFFFFF>+10%</col>.<br><br>Doing the activity won't increase your temperature gauge.<br><br>This effect lasts <col=FFFFFF>15 mins</col>.
data=col1,6,false,George's Peach Delight,<br>Drinking this will aid your skill at the '<col=FFFFFF>Sandcastle Building</col>' activity.<br><br>XP gain is increased by <col=FFFFFF>+10%</col>.<br><br>You can shovel sand up to <col=FFFFFF>60 times</col> before you need a rest.<br><br>Doing the activity won't increase your temperature gauge.<br><br>This effect lasts <col=FFFFFF>15 mins</col>.

