data=col6,Premier Membership
data=col7,
data=col8,Standard Membership (Single Purchase, Time Limited)<br><br><col=0xE0D471>Benefits Include:</col><br>- Explore a 3x larger game map<br>- Access to 210+ extra member's only quests<br>- 12 additional skills<br>- Play 40+ awesome member's only minigames<br>- Over 5x more bank slots<br>- Double daily Keys for the Treasure Hunter minigame<br>- Get Loyalty Points to spend on in-game cosmetics<br>- And much more!<br><br>Enjoy a host of extra rewards with Premier Membership including:<br>- 150,000 Loyalty Points<br>- The Premier Artefact<br>- Ceremonial Guard Armour override<br>- Premier Pass Yak Track rewards<br>- Monthly drops<br>- 3 Premier reward tokens<br>- 50% runemetrics discount<br>- Premier vault access<br>- 1 free boss instance per week<br>- 100 extra bank space<br>- And an in game chat badge!
data=col9,<col=0xE0D471>Terms and Conditions:</col>
