data=col5,Portable Skilling Packs
data=col6,Portable skilling packs contains portable skilling stations which can be placed down to train skills anywhere with various bonuses.<br>You can choose from portable ranges, sawmills, wells, fletchers, crafters, braziers, workbenches and luminite injectors.

