// 5162
[dbrow_5162]
table=dbtable_130
data=col1,0,true,Event Information,During Frank's Free Deaths, a <col=0x00ffff>group of bosses or areas is spotlighted</col> each week. <col=0x00ffff>If you die</col> from fighting one of these bosses or in one of these areas, Death will make an exception and <col=0x00ffff>return your lost items for free!</col><br><br><col=0x00ffff>Whenever a week is almost over</col> - meaning that you'll be in danger of losing your items again during those encounters - <col=0x00ffff>you will be notified.</col><br><br>The event will run for <col=0x00ffff>four weeks</col> in total.<br><br>You can track active bosses for this event on the <col=0x00ffff>Beasts</col> tab in the <<col=0x00ffff>Adventures</col> interface.<br>Bosses in <col=0x00FF00>green</col> are active in the current week.<br>Bosses in <col=0xF99222>orange</col> will be active in the next week.
data=col1,1,true,Barrows & Angel of Death,Members only.<br><br>Death will <col=0x00ffff>return your items for free,</col> if you die to any of these bosses:<br>  - Nex - Angel of Death<br>  - The Barrows: Rise of the Six<br>  - The Barrows Brothers
data=col1,1,true,God Wars Dungeons,Members only.<br><br>Death will <col=0x00ffff>return your items for free,</col> if you die to any of these bosses:<br>  - Telos<br>  - Nex<br>  - Helwyr<br>  - Gregorovic<br>  - The Twin Furies<br>  - Vindicta & Gorvek<br>  - Commander Zilyana<br>  - General Graardor<br>  - Kree'arra<br>  - K'ril Tsutsaroth
data=col1,1,true,Kings and Queens,Members only <col=0x00ffff>except for King Black Dragon</col>.</col><br><br>Death will <col=0x00ffff>return your items for free,</col> if you die to any of these bosses:<br>  - Solak<br>  - Rex Matriarchs<br>  - King Black Dragon<br>  - Queen Black Dragon<br>  - Kalphite King<br>  - Kalphite Queen<br>  - Exiled Kalphite Queen<br>  - Dagannoth Kings
data=col1,1,true,Elite Dungeons & Raksha,Members only.<br><br>Death will <col=0x00ffff>return your items for free,</col> if you die to any of these bosses:<br>  - Raksha<br>  - The Sanctum Guardian<br>  - Masuta the Ascended<br>  - Seiryu the Azure Serpent<br>  - Astellarn<br>  - Verak Lith<br>  - Black Stone Dragon<br>  - The Crassian Leviathan<br>  - Taraket the Necromancer<br>  - The Ambassador<br>  - The Magister<br><br>Death will also <col=0x00ffff>return your items for free,</col> if you die in any of these areas:<br>  - Temple of Aminishi<br>  - Dragonkin Laboratory<br>  - Shadow Reef

