// 5318
[dbrow_5318]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Each offer box has two buttons. This one is for offering to buy items.
data=col5,interface_105:com_15
data=col6,-1
data=col7,2
data=col9,2
data=col10,1
data=col16,"grand_exchange_buy_sell_icon,0"

// 5319
[dbrow_5319]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,And this one is for offering to sell items.
data=col5,interface_105:com_21
data=col6,-1
data=col7,2
data=col9,2
data=col10,1
data=col16,"grand_exchange_buy_sell_icon,2"

// 5320
[dbrow_5320]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,If you selected the 'Buy' option, you would see this screen. You can look for an item to buy by using the search box here.
data=col9,2
data=col10,1
data=col21,interface_105:com_326,-1

// 5321
[dbrow_5321]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,You can set how many you wish to buy, and the price you're willing to pay, before clicking the 'Confirm Offer' button. We'll suggest a guide price for the item, but you can offer whatever you like.
data=col9,2
data=col10,1
data=col21,interface_105:com_239,-1
data=col21,interface_105:com_280,-1

// 5322
[dbrow_5322]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,You can set how many you wish to buy, and the price you're willing to pay, before tapping the 'Confirm Offer' button. We'll suggest a guide price for the item, but you can offer whatever you like.
data=col9,2
data=col10,1
data=col21,interface_105:com_239,-1
data=col21,interface_105:com_280,-1

// 5323
[dbrow_5323]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Now the offer is placed! You can return to the Grand Exchange at any time to check on the progress of your offers.
data=col5,interface_105:com_7
data=col6,-1
data=col9,2
data=col10,1

// 5324
[dbrow_5324]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Selling items is very similar. You'll be able to select items from your inventory to sell them.
data=col9,2
data=col10,1

