// 5333
[dbrow_5333]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,This button can be used to convert your items into <col=FFcb05>bank notes</col> when withdrawn, which take up only one Backpack space, and can be freely traded.
data=col5,interface_517:com_127
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col16,"bank_buttons_new1,4"
data=col21,interface_517:com_127,-1

// 5334
[dbrow_5334]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,This section displays available bank space. If a search or filter is active it shows the number of items found.<br><br>Additional space can be purchased in the Bank interface.
data=col5,interface_517:com_238
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col21,interface_517:com_238,-1

// 5335
[dbrow_5335]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These buttons can be used to deposit all the items from your Backpack, person, beast of burden, or coin pouch at once.
data=col5,interface_517:com_37
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col16,"bank_bob_button,1"
data=col21,interface_517:com_39,-1
data=col21,interface_517:com_42,-1
data=col21,interface_517:com_45,-1
data=col21,interface_517:com_51,-1

// 5336
[dbrow_5336]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,This button toggles Bank placeholders, which take effect when withdrawing all items from a Bank slot.<br><br>When enabled the Bank slot is reserved for the item that was there.<br><br>When disabled, the slot will be emptied and made available for other items.
data=col5,interface_517:com_122
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col21,interface_517:com_122,-1

// 5337
[dbrow_5337]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,You can access your items at any bank in the game world.<br><br>Search for this icon on your Minimap or the World Map!
data=col16,rs3_icon_worldmap_bank

