// 5339
[dbrow_5339]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The Preset tab allows you to save sets of items which you can quickly withdraw from your preset.

// 5340
[dbrow_5340]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Here you will see the items which the preset will attempt to load.
