data=col6,-1
data=col7,3

// 5341
[dbrow_5341]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,To store what you have currently equipped as a preset, use the overwrite button.<br><br>The checkboxes indicate which inventories will be loaded when using the 'load' button.
