// 5371
[dbrow_5371]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,This part of the interface contains details of various RuneScape minigames.

// 5372
[dbrow_5372]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Selecting a minigame will bring up details of the minigame in the area on the right.
