// 5378
[dbrow_5378]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The Animations tab shows all the different animations you can apply to your character.

// 5379
[dbrow_5379]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These buttons can be used to explore the different categories of animation.<br><br>Any animations you have access to will be shown in the area to the right.
