// 5388
[dbrow_5388]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Pets are designed to keep you company as you explore the game.<br><br>Some can be bought, while others are given as rewards for completing quests and other pieces of content.

// 5389
[dbrow_5389]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These buttons can be used to view the different types of pet. Pets you own or that can be unlocked will be shown in the area to the right.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_146
data=col6,-1

// 5390
[dbrow_5390]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Some pets can have their appearance customised using these buttons.
