// 5398
[dbrow_5398]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Titles can be used to make your character's name more interesting.<br><br>Some can be bought, while others are given as rewards for completing quests and other pieces of content.

// 5399
[dbrow_5399]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These buttons can be used to explore the different categories of title.<br><br>Any titles you have access to will be shown in the area to the right.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_146
data=col6,-1
data=col7,4

// 5400
[dbrow_5400]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Selecting a title will display it here, alongside your character's name.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_344
data=col6,-1

// 5401
[dbrow_5401]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The <col=FFcb05>apply</col> button will apply the title to your character.<br><br>If you don't have access to the title this, button will allow you to <col=FFcb05>buy</col> it.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_475
data=col6,-1

