// 5437
[dbrow_5437]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Here you can see your current skill levels.<br><br>Hovering over a skill will give you an XP breakdown, while right-clicking a skill will let you set a level target. This can be useful if you want to access a piece of content with a particular level requirement.
