data=col6,-1

// 5609
[dbrow_5609]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These gems contain the fantastic prizes in this game of Treasure Hunter! All of the chests contain one of these prizes, guaranteed! You may be offered some alternate prizes in some cases!
data=col5,interface_1253:com_349
data=col6,-1

// 5610
[dbrow_5610]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,You can open one chest per game, and it will cost you one key to get the goodies waiting inside. To play, simply click a chest!<br><br>Good luck, and remember to come back every day to use your free keys!
