table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The gems above the chest show the possible <col=0xB32AB6>rarity</col> of prizes which are available and the current <col=0x26c914>multiplier</col>.<br>These change once the gems break.

// 6030
[dbrow_6030]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Breaking 5 gems can trigger <col=0xffcb05>Gemfall</col>. A bonus where you can claim <col=0x14c3c9>2 free prizes</col> from a selection!

// 6031
[dbrow_6031]
table=dbtable_156
data=col0,Gemfall
data=col1,Break gems and trigger the Gemfall!
data=col3,5
data=col5,Open chests to take advantage of powerful guaranteed <col=0xB32AB6>minimum rarities</col> and <col=0x26c914>multipliers</col> up to <col=0xB32AB6>3x Guaranteed Purple</col> prizes!<br>Claiming prizes has a chance to break the gems. If your gems break you'll get a new bonus!<br>Don't like your modifier? <col=0xffcb05>Reroll</col> it with oddments! You have a total of 3 rerolls for every <col=0xffcb05>Gemfall</col> that occurs. 
data=col6,Gemfall
data=col7,Breaking 5 gems will cause a <col=0xffcb05>Gemfall!</col> While this is active you can claim <col=0xffcb05><tostring(2)> extra prizes</col> for free!
data=col8,Promotion Information
