data=col3,Earn <col=0xFFCB05>Rainbow Dust</col> each time you spend a key and earn more from the <col=0xFFCB05>Rainbow Dust</col> modifier.<br>Spend your <col=0xFFCB05>Rainbow Dust</col> to upgrade all multipliers to the one shown on the left. Click on them to see them all.
