data=col5,Phoenix lamps!
data=col6,- Win Phoenix lamps.<br>- Phoenix lamps give XP in a skill of your choice.<br>- Using a phoenix lamp on a skill that you have Bonus XP in will instantly burn up that Bonus XP and convert it into additional direct XP. Phoenix lamps also have a chance to not be consumed on use.

// 6103
