table=dbtable_158
data=col3,trh179_modifier_hydra,100,100
data=col4,0
data=col5,Hydra lamps!
data=col6,- Win Hydra lamps.<br>- Hydra lamps give you XP in up to 2 skills of your choice.<br>- Using a hydra lamp on a skill that you have Bonus XP in will instantly burn up that Bonus XP and convert it into additional direct XP.

// 6105
