data=col0,Contagion
data=col1,Delve deep into the blighted lands and assist the plague doctors to uncover rewards!
data=col3,7
data=col5,Use Treasure Hunter keys to open chests and win rewards! Keys can be purchased or earned through completing quests and playing the game. You will also be given free daily keys every day!
data=col6,Plague levels
data=col7,The more chests you open the stronger the plague gets and the more likely you are to find a<col=95FF4E> Plague Chest</col> and its coveted prizes within.
