// 6243
[dbrow_6243]
table=dbtable_130
data=col0,View Titles
data=col1,0,true,the Beachbum,Successfully hit 5 coconuts in a row on the coconut shy.
data=col1,1,true,Beachcomber,Complete the following activities:<br><br>- Play the coconut shy<br>- Take part in the strongman activity<br>- Catch a tropical trout<br>- Prepare some food at the cooking station<br>- Harvest and drop off a coconut<br>- Help build a sandcastle
data=col1,2,true,the Bronzed,Reach maximum temperature 10 times.
data=col1,3,true,the Chilled,Eat 10 ice creams.
data=col1,4,true,the Lifeguard,Kill Clawdia 50 times.
data=col1,5,true,the Quackers,Find 10 hidden rubber ducks on the beach using a spade. Get digging!
data=col1,6,true,the Totally Quackers,A bonus title which can be obtained by unlocking the 'Quackers' title and the 'Mega ducklings' boss pet.
data=col1,7,true,the Sunburned,Reach maximum temperature 25 times.
data=col1,8,true,the Beachy Keen,Successfully catch 5 ducks in a row on the hook-a-duck game.
data=col1,9,true,the Feathered,Find 10 hidden rubber ducks on the beach using a spade. Get digging!
data=col1,10,true,the Sunkissed,Find and listen to a large shell 10 times.
data=col1,11,true,the Sun-sational,Unlock the 'Beachcomber' title, then complete the following activities:<br><br>- Play hook-a-duck<br>- Enter the Dungeoneering hole
data=col1,12,true,King/Queen of the Sandcastle,Unlock the following titles:<br>- the Beachbum<br>- the Bronzed<br>- Beachcomber<br>- the Chilled<br>- the Lifeguard<br>- the Quackers<br>- the Sunburned
data=col1,13,true,Emperor/Empress of the Sandcastle,Unlock the 'King/Queen of the Sandcastle' title, then unlock the additional titles:<br><br>- the Beachy Keen<br>- the Feathered<br>- the Sunkissed<br>- the Sun-sational
data=col1,14,true,the Completesunist,Unlock the 'Emperor/Empress of the Sandcastle' title, then complete the following additional tasks:<br><br>- Unlock the Deckchair resting animation by resting in a red, green and blue deckchair 10 times each<br>- Unlock the rainbow kite by talking to Reyna, Nigel, Palmer, Sarah and Wellington<br>- Unlock the Beach Towel cape override by resting on the beach 10 times with a beach rest animation active<br>- Unlock the Beach Swimming outfit by reaching maximum temperature 50 times.<br>- Unlock the Beach Summer Fun outfit by reaching maximum temperature 100 times.

