data=col3,What you see is what you get, with multipliers too!<br><br>Choose the prize you want with <col=0x26c914>prize multipliers</col> between 1 and 5 as well!<br><br>If you use <col=0xFFCB05>multi key mode</col>, the promo will choose the most valuable prize for you, depending on the rarity and multiplier of each available prize.

// 6385
