data=col0,Academy of Heroes
data=col1,Kill monsters to unlock bonus rewards and level up your hero
data=col3,13
data=col5,Level up aspiring heroes, slay monsters, claim loot and unlock milestone rewards.
data=col6,Monster Loot & Milestone Rewards
data=col7,Every slain monster will give you 3 bonus rewards as well as levelling up your Hero!<br>When your Hero reaches certain milestone levels you'll unlock bonus rare prizes too!<br>Level up your Hero to the maximum combat level of 138 to begin training a new one. This allows you to gain those milestone rewards over and over!
