data=col2,2
data=col4,5
data=col5,Portable Skilling Packs
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Medium portable skilling pack</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>2 x Huge portable skilling packs</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Medium portable skilling pack.<br>- Large portable skilling packs.<br>- Huge portable skilling packs.<br>- 2 x Huge portable skilling packs!<br><br>This wish has a 12.5% chance as appearing as a wish option.

