data=col6,Loot Room
data=col7,Opening a special chest will put a copy of it in the <col=0xFFCB05>Loot Room</col>. Whenever the <col=0xFFCB05>Loot Room</col> is full you can claim <col=0xFFCB05>4 of the chests for free!</col>
