data=col3,<col=FFCB05>Buried Bargains</col>, ran by <col=FFCB05>Sostratus</col>, is the City of Um's <col=FFCB05>equipment shop</col>.<br><br>Head over there to pick up a set of <col=FFCB05>necromancer robes</col>.
