// 7842
[dbrow_7842]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Opening chests will move <col=FF00>multipliers</col> down the Tinkerer's Trail. Your chest will have its reward multiplied by the <col=FF00>active multiplier</col> here, up to a maximum of <col=FF00>x8</col>!
data=col5,interface_760:com_27
data=col6,-1
data=col7,4
data=col21,interface_760:com_27,-1

// 7843
[dbrow_7843]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Opening chests will give you <col=FFFF00>Curios</col>. Collect these to spend on <col=FF00>Curio Bonuses</col> to <col=FF00>buff your multipliers</col>!<br><br>You also have a chance of <col=FF00>Curio Bonuses</col> appearing along the trail!
data=col5,interface_760:com_44
data=col6,-1
data=col7,2
data=col21,interface_760:com_44,-1

// 7844
[dbrow_7844]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Here you can find information on these <col=FF00>Curio Bonuses</col>. Buying a bonus gives you the option of two random <col=FF00>Curio Bonuses</col>.
data=col5,interface_760:com_3
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col21,interface_760:com_3,-1

// 7845
[dbrow_7845]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,You can now choose a <col=FF00>Curio Bonus</col>!<br> Your left option will set all multipliers to a <col=FF00>minimum multiplier (up to x8)</col>.<br>Your right option will <col=FF00>increase all multipliers (by up to +5)</col>.
data=col5,interface_760:com_49
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col21,interface_760:com_49,-1

// 7846
[dbrow_7846]
table=dbtable_156
data=col0,Tinkerer's Trail
data=col1,Collect Curios for modified multipliers!
data=col3,5
data=col5,Open chests to receive a prize with a <col=FF00>multiplier</col> up to <col=FF00>x8</col>!<br>Your upcoming multipliers can be seen moving down the Tinkerer's Trail.
data=col6,Curio Bonus
data=col7,Gather <col=FFFF00>Curios</col> by opening chests.<br>Spend the <col=FFFF00>Curios</col> for a choice of <col=FF00>Curio Bonuses</col>.<br>You will always have a choice of an <col=FF00>Increased Multiplier</col> bonus and a <col=FF00>Minimum Multiplier</col> bonus while not having all maximum multipliers (x8).
data=col8,Promotion Information
data=col9,dbrow_8387
data=col9,dbrow_8386
data=col9,dbrow_7847
data=col9,dbrow_7850

