data=col1,Botanist's Workbench
data=col2,model_131143
data=col3,Access to the botanist's bench and Granny Rowan's herblore services.
data=col3,Granny Rowan can decant your potions and blubbers for you.
data=col4,Granny Rowan has a limited stock of tradeable herblore supplies available for purchase.
data=col4,You are now able to receive unnoted vials of water from the botanist's workbench.
data=col5,Granny Rowan will prepare overloads and overload salves for you, allowing you to make them in larger quantities at the botanist's workbench.

