// 12739
[dbrow_12739]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,To celebrate your return to Gielinor, you can earn unique rewards by completing special returner challenges.
data=col4,Welcome back!,65280
data=col5,interface_1343:com_3
data=col6,-1
data=col8,1

// 12740
[dbrow_12740]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Completing these challenges fills the progress bar, which unlocks new rewards for every three challenges you complete.
data=col5,interface_1343:com_26
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col21,interface_1343:com_149,-1

// 12741
[dbrow_12741]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,At the end of the day, you will receive new challenges. However, you will keep any challenges that haven't been completed, so you can take your time with more difficult tasks.
